Package: nls-netos
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, dpdk
Recommends: linux-tools-common
Description: NLS-NetOS router operating system platform
 NLS-NetOS is a Linux-based router operating-system project providing
 platform discovery, CPU and memory management, routing/forwarding
 components, cryptography, Router-CA, IPsec, TLS, database support,
 and a native DPDK packet-forwarding component.
 .
 The packaged native forwarder uses DPDK's PMD layer for hardware-specific
 NIC operations; it does not directly program vendor MMIO registers.
